    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλέχομαι</span></b> , pres. only in <i><span class="en">
			Cypr.
		</span></i> imper. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλέχες</span></b>  (fort.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλέχεο</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάκεισο</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγω</span> A); 
				Ep.
			 only in 
				Med.
			 and 
				Pass.
			
			fut. and aor.:—<i>lie down, go to
				bed</i>: aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατελέξατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.690
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.555
			</span></i>: non-thematic aor. (or impf.) 
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέλεκτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.662
				</span></i>
			, etc.; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλέγμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.196
				</span></i>
			; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλέχθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.394
				</span></i>
			: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλέξομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					523
				</span></i>
			.</div>
